WEBVTT

00:09:29.982 --> 00:09:31.150
I share that photo.

00:09:31.191 --> 00:09:33.152
Now, as you can imagine, on social media,

00:09:33.193 --> 00:09:36.447
a lot of people were as shocked
and offended as I was.

00:09:36.488 --> 00:09:38.741
But a lot of people were like,
“That’s strange,

00:09:38.741 --> 00:09:41.410
because that doesn't connect
with the beauty in his eyes

00:09:41.452 --> 00:09:43.245
and the humanity in him."

00:09:43.621 --> 00:09:45.914
So I went back to him
and I said, "Look, Kevin,

00:09:45.914 --> 00:09:47.833
there's this thing called social media.

00:09:47.833 --> 00:09:50.794
I know you've been here too long
and you don't know about this,

00:09:50.836 --> 00:09:53.797
but people are writing comments,
I'm going to read them to you.

00:09:53.839 --> 00:09:55.841
And I think some of them
you should answer.

00:09:55.883 --> 00:09:58.594
So we started talking,
and I did many and many videos

00:09:58.594 --> 00:10:00.888
and asking him again and again,
and he responded